hy in production. (v2.3.1-rc was healthy but only in staging, so I excluded it.)\n\n**Actions**\n1. **Rolled back checkout-api to v2.3.0** in all production regions \u2014 status: `rolled_out`, confirmed on v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west, and eu-west.\n2. **Opened SEV2 incident INC-0001** for checkout-api (on-call has been paged), documenting the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, and follow-ups: verify error rate recovery on v2.3.0 and root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before any redeploy.\n\nNo new (never-healthy) versions were deployed, so no change-manager approval was required.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the current status and release history for checkout-api.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Vzj65wnhWpvNsK2Nv4qXs1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Xnmbj66DAKWd3p8hpvXQMm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01GHarHK7HodXtSrsLq2G7yB", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Rollback is rolled out to all three regions. Opening the SEV2 incident.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016HJ5BHp7eEP3kxMrjn9gsV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (healthy=false, error_rate=0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Action taken: rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production, in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Rollback status: rolled_out. Note: v2.3.1-rc was healthy only in staging and was not used. Follow-up needed: confirm health/error rate recovery on v2.3.0 and root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before any redeploy.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Done. Summary of what I did:\n\n**Diagnosis**\n- checkout-api was running v2.3.1 in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), unhealthy with an 18% error rate.\n- Release history showed v2.3.0 as the most recent release that was healthy in production. (v2.3.1-rc was healthy but only in staging, so I excluded it.)\n\n**Actions**\n1. **Rolled back checkout-api to v2.3.0** in all production regions \u2014 status: `rolled_out`, confirmed on v2.3.0 in us-east, us-west, and eu-west.\n2. **Opened SEV2 incident INC-0001** for checkout-api (on-call has been paged), documenting the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, and follow-ups: verify error rate recovery on v2.3.0 and root-cause the v2.3.1 regression before any redeploy.\n\nNo new (never-healthy) versions were deployed, so no change-manager approval was required.", "type": "text"}]}]}